    "detailed_description": "<h1>BE PART OF OUR COMMUNITY Test</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/8ee2b92fe8486a1a91051383fdb7faf3.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/f682ec5374a1d182e5b88800a0398b1b.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/77a999cd8ca189754e27d227799ff67d.avif?t=1753687963\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast. Fierce. Frictionless.<br>Step into Rivals Hover League, the official vehicular combat sport spreading across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pilot, you\u2019ll take control of a hover vehicle, dominate the arena, grow with your team, and rise to legend.<br>Outplay your rival \u2014 Hover, Boost, Shoot Your Way to MVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/9ca13b177f8f428dfb2ac58091062368.avif?t=1753687963\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the ground. Out here, motion never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your hover as it glides, drifts, and blasts through the arena with gravity-defying boosts, high-flying jumps, and precision braking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vehicle feels like a real machine with weight, friction, and impact you can feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot, every turn, every second. It all starts at your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/568f59a95bd7e3a5f1faf6007fd7366a.avif?t=1753687963\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of up to four and enter the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hover alone, but victory? That takes teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with your crew, lock onto your rivals, and push through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hover the arena together. Make the win yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/63e97a3cc96996b30bffa6c1154189d8.avif?t=1753687963\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice through rivals with speed,<br>shield your team with brute force,<br>or disrupt the field with tactical tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from unique hover classes, each designed with its own edge in combat.<br>The right Hover in the right hands? That\u2019s your competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1db2bd0dbfe0e7480ae9b8a5c9d8a68c.avif?t=1753687963\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivals Hover League isn\u2019t built for just one way to win.<br>Each match brings different rules, objectives, and arenas. With them, new strategies and shifting team dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast, play smart, and turn every game into your own kind of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/97243dd545b89363dc94188e0251c307.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and hop into our official Discord!<br>Chat with the devs, clash in pilot tournaments, and help shape the future of RHL, together with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're building RHL <i>with</i> you, one hover at a time!</p>",
