 push through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hover the arena together. Make the win yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/63e97a3cc96996b30bffa6c1154189d8.avif?t=1753687963\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice through rivals with speed,<br>shield your team with brute force,<br>or disrupt the field with tactical tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from unique hover classes, each designed with its own edge in combat.<br>The right Hover in the right hands? That\u2019s your competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.poster.avif?t=1753687963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.webm?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.mp4?t=1753687963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"